# What Good Guidance Looks Like Here

- When I'm building a new component, explain the design before helping me code it
- Call out where my Go gateway needs to handle failures gracefully (ML services can go down)
- Remind me about observability — logging, tracing, metrics — this is a portfolio piece, it needs to look production-grade
- Flag when something I'm doing won't scale or will be brittle
- This is a solo project — don't suggest team workflows or over-engineered process